{
  "/foundation-partners": {
    "title": "Foundation partners - Rise Above Capital Region Cancer Relief",
    "text": "ABOUT RA\nSUPPORT\nGET INVOLVED\nOUR PARTNERS\nNEWS\nCONTACT US\nREFER A FRIEND\nLOGIN\nDONATE\nGET SUPPORT\nFOUNDATION PARTNERS\n\nFrom the beginning, our 2 foundation partners have championed for local cancer patients by providing ongoing financial and in kind support to Rise Above. Thanks to our foundation partners every local cancer patient undergoing treatment is eligible for Rise Above’s support, regardless of their age or the type of cancer!\n\nFind out more\nFind out more\n\nI just wanted to say a quick thank you, for everything that rise above has done to help me so far with my treatment. \n\nIt's amazing that through some very difficult times, I feel so supported and safe.”\n\nRyan K\n\nMore about our partners\nCommunity partners\nPartner with us\nRise Above provides assistance & support for cancer patients of any age\nKeep up with the latest\nFirst name *\nLast name *\nKeep up with the latest\nEmail\nSIGN UP\n(02) 6297 1261\nhello@riseabovecbr.org.au\n21 Cooma Street, Queanbeyan\n\nFollow us\n\nABOUT RA\nWho are we\nOur staff & board members\nOur life members\nOur ambassadors & patrons\nOur supporters\nNews\nContact us\nSUPPORT\nGet financial assistance\nFind a support service\nRefer a friend\nGET INVOLVED\nMake a donation\nLeave a bequest\nGive in memory\nJoin an event\nFundraise for us\nPartner with us\nBecome a volunteer\nBecome a Member\nBuy merchandise\nOUR PARTNERS\nFoundation partners\nCommunity partners\nCharity partners\nPartner with us\n\n© 2026 Rise Above\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and Conditions",
