  "/community-partners": {
    "title": "Community partners - Rise Above Capital Region Cancer Relief",
    "text": "ABOUT RA\nSUPPORT\nGET INVOLVED\nOUR PARTNERS\nNEWS\nCONTACT US\nREFER A FRIEND\nLOGIN\nDONATE\nGET SUPPORT\nCOMMUNITY PARTNERS\n\nMaking positive financial change to locals navigating a cancer diagnosis would not be possible without the support of our ongoing community partners.\n\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\nFind out more\n\nWhen Alex became sick Rise Above was amazing with the support they offered us. Not having to worry about the huge cost of his pain relief medication removed an enormous stress for us, you were so incredibly helpful at a time when it was so hard to cope”.\n\nAlex’s Mum, Kate\n\nMore about our partners\nFoundation partners\nPartner with us\nRise Above provides assistance & support for cancer patients of any age\nKeep up with the latest\nFirst name *\nLast name *\nKeep up with the latest\nEmail\nSIGN UP\n(02) 6297 1261\nhello@riseabovecbr.org.au\n21 Cooma Street, Queanbeyan\n\nFollow us\n\nABOUT RA\nWho are we\nOur staff & board members\nOur life members\nOur ambassadors & patrons\nOur supporters\nNews\nContact us\nSUPPORT\nGet financial assistance\nFind a support service\nRefer a friend\nGET INVOLVED\nMake a donation\nLeave a bequest\nGive in memory\nJoin an event\nFundraise for us\nPartner with us\nBecome a volunteer\nBecome a Member\nBuy merchandise\nOUR PARTNERS\nFoundation partners\nCommunity partners\nCharity partners\nPartner with us\n\n© 2026 Rise Above\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and Conditions",
