  "/charity-partners": {
    "title": "Charity partners - Rise Above Capital Region Cancer Relief",
    "text": "ABOUT RA\nSUPPORT\nGET INVOLVED\nOUR PARTNERS\nNEWS\nCONTACT US\nREFER A FRIEND\nLOGIN\nDONATE\nGET SUPPORT\nCHARITY PARTNERS\n\nRise Above is honored to partner with 2 local charities to provide comprehensive support to our community! These exciting collaborations bring together our strengths to tackle the diverse challenges faced by individuals and their families, while creating a truly supportive environment. within the ACT & QPRC region.\n\nTogether, we are passionately committed to improving quality of life, offering vital assistance, care, compassion, and hope to everyone we have the privilege of supporting in the community.\n\nFind out more\nFind out more\nMore about our partners\nFoundation partners\nPartner with us\nRise Above provides assistance & support for cancer patients of any age\nKeep up with the latest\nFirst name *\nLast name *\nKeep up with the latest\nEmail\nSIGN UP\n(02) 6297 1261\nhello@riseabovecbr.org.au\n21 Cooma Street, Queanbeyan\n\nFollow us\n\nABOUT RA\nWho are we\nOur staff & board members\nOur life members\nOur ambassadors & patrons\nOur supporters\nNews\nContact us\nSUPPORT\nGet financial assistance\nFind a support service\nRefer a friend\nGET INVOLVED\nMake a donation\nLeave a bequest\nGive in memory\nJoin an event\nFundraise for us\nPartner with us\nBecome a volunteer\nBecome a Member\nBuy merchandise\nOUR PARTNERS\nFoundation partners\nCommunity partners\nCharity partners\nPartner with us\n\n© 2026 Rise Above\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and Conditions",
